      "values are identical in both profiles; only the index order differs.",
      "crates/renderer/tests/aircraft_asset_g3c.rs asserts positional material indices against the",
      "committed production GLB. A future production cutover to a Blender-exported GLB must",
      "therefore either restore the production material order or update those assertions in the",
